{"unit_id":"CoachLeong__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"CoachLeong/dsh-notify","commit":"185abcdcd63a8dcdfcbc73ebab839a9cf623af34","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的浏览器桌面通知插件。它通过订阅会话列表状态变化，在模型开始输出、完成一轮输出，或会话等待权限审批、问题回答、计划评审时发送提醒；通知可按会话替换，点击后聚焦页面并打开对应会话。设置页提供通知总开关、三类事件开关、仅页面隐藏时提醒选项，以及权限申请和测试通知。适合希望离开 DSH 页面时仍能及时响应会话进度的用户。通知权限由浏览器管理，偏好保存在本地 localStorage；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:76-154","src/ui.tsx:57-103","src/config-store.ts:21-57"]}
{"unit_id":"CoachLeong__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"CoachLeong/dsh-notify","commit":"185abcdcd63a8dcdfcbc73ebab839a9cf623af34","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify alerts DSH web users when a model starts or finishes, or a session needs approval, answers, or plan review. Its settings control event and hidden-page alerts. Clicking a notification opens the session. Preferences use browser localStorage; notification permission is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:76-154","src/ui.tsx:57-103","src/config-store.ts:21-57"]}
