{"unit_id":"CoachLeong__dsh-notify#feature-1","repo":"CoachLeong/dsh-notify","commit":"185abcdcd63a8dcdfcbc73ebab839a9cf623af34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「会话状态提醒」：会话列表显示模型开始或结束运行时发送浏览器桌面通知。用户可分别关闭开始和完成提醒，并可限制为页面不可见时通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:76-113","src/types.ts:1-13"]}
{"unit_id":"CoachLeong__dsh-notify#feature-2","repo":"CoachLeong/dsh-notify","commit":"185abcdcd63a8dcdfcbc73ebab839a9cf623af34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「待处理事项提醒」：会话进入审批、问题或计划评审等待状态时发送通知；审批可显示工具及原因，问题显示截断后的问题内容，计划评审提示返回会话查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:52-74","src/client.ts:116-123"]}
{"unit_id":"CoachLeong__dsh-notify#feature-3","repo":"CoachLeong/dsh-notify","commit":"185abcdcd63a8dcdfcbc73ebab839a9cf623af34","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 的功能「通知设置」：在 DSH 设置页提供通知总开关、事件分类开关、页面隐藏时才提醒的选项，并允许申请浏览器通知权限或发送测试通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/ui.tsx:57-103","src/client.ts:159-165"]}
{"unit_id":"CoachLeong__dsh-notify#caveat-1","repo":"CoachLeong/dsh-notify","commit":"185abcdcd63a8dcdfcbc73ebab839a9cf623af34","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 使用浏览器 Notification API，首次使用需在浏览器允许通知；偏好存于该浏览器的 localStorage，不会同步为 DSH 账户设置。多标签页去重依赖 Web Locks API。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:79-88","src/config-store.ts:21-57"]}
